nd designation of statement</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/4E">4E.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/4E">Power to revise statement</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/part/I/crossheading/commissions-general-functions">Commission’s general functions</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/5">Reports on elections, referendums etc.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/5A">5A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/5A">Further provision about reports on Welsh elections</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6">Reviews of electoral and political matters.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6ZA">6ZA.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6ZA">Reviews of electoral and political matters: devolved Scottish elections</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6ZAn1">6ZA.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6ZAn1">Reviews of devolved electoral matters in Wales</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6A">6A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6A">Attendance of representatives of Commission at elections etc.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6B">6B.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6B">Observation of working practices by representatives of Commission</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6C">6C.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6C">Accredited observers: individuals</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6D">6D.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6D">Accredited observers: organisations</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6E">6E.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6E">Attendance and conduct of observers</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6F">6F.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6F">Code of practice on attendance of observers at elections etc.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6G">6G.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6G">Code of practice on attendance of observers at Scottish Parliamentary elections and local government elections in Scotland</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6Gn1">6G.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6Gn1">Code of practice on attendance of observers at devolved elections in Wales</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6H">6H.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/6H">Code of practice on expenditure of candidates at Scottish parliamentary elections</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/7">7.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/7">Commission to be consulted on changes to electoral law.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/8">8.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/8">Powers with respect to elections exercisable only on Commission recommendation.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/9">9.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/9">Involvement of Commission in changes in electoral procedures.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/9A">9A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/9A">Setting of performance standards</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p cla