tsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/12">Policy development grants.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/13">13.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/13">Education about electoral and democratic systems.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/13A">13A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/13A">Reimbursement of costs by Scottish Ministers etc.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/part/I/crossheading/examination-of-commissions-duty-to-have-regard-to-strategy-and-policy-statement">Examination of Commission’s duty to have regard to strategy and policy statement</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/13ZA">13ZA.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/13ZA">Examination of duty to have regard to strategy and policy statement</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/part/I/crossheading/commissions-electoral-boundary-functions">Commission’s electoral boundary functions</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/14">14.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/14">Boundary committees.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/15">15.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/15">Deputy Electoral Commissioners.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/16">16.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/16">Transfer of functions of Boundary Commissions.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/17">17.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/17">Transfer of property etc. of the Boundary Commissions.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/18">18.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/18">Transfer of functions of Local Government Commission for England.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/19">19.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/19">Transfer of functions of Local Government Boundary Commission for Scotland.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/20">20.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/section/20">Transfer of functions of Local Government Boundary Commission for Wales.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/2000/41/part/I/crossheading/commissions-functions-relating-to-core">Commission's functions relating to CORE</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="